  //   also read in the closing (Arlo's capitals), and f9s1's picks[0] 2 (off the root cause) has its own closing line.
  // SOME PATHS (don't rely on these after ch9): whether Hana's addendum is in AR 2207's file from Feb 20 (f9s1 best) or later; the independent
  //   reviewer from the ARA's mission assurance office (f9s1 best); whether the board received the full closure history (f9s4 best) or a
  //   statement naming Hana (f9s4 0, public, sets sacrificedhana; f9s4 3 goes to the board only); Wendell's procedure and cross training program (f9s5 best); the charter
